WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.670
<v Priya>Tuesday. Our AI agent cleared an AML alert.

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:06.290
<v Auditor>Why was this cleared? Who allowed it?

3
00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:08.870
<v Priya>All I had was the agent's own log.

4
00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:10.600
<v Priya>Anyone could have edited it.

5
00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:15.080
<v Priya>So we put agent-custody in front of it.

6
00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:17.100
<v Priya>Same alert. Checked first.

7
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:17.900
<v Priya>Denied.

8
00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:19.730
<v Priya>And the refusal is signed.

9
00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:22.620
<v Auditor>It verifies. Public key only.

10
00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:25.120
<v Priya>Change one word, and it fails.

11
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:27.890
<v Priya>Now I don't explain what our agents did.

12
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:29.160
<v Priya>I prove it.
